        {
          "kind": "code",
          "text": "pipx install \"hrx-loom[hf]==0.2.0\"\nloom-fetch huggingface:loom-fun/unsloth-Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-loom:vision-mtp --materialize=copy --output=Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-loom\nloom-serve --model=Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-loom '--device=amdgpu://?completion_spin_ns=4294967295' --pool_backing=fixed"
        },
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "text": "- `--materialize=copy` puts copies of the fetched package files in the output directory.\n- `completion_spin_ns=4294967295` enables active waiting for GPU completions (uses CPU while GPU work is in flight); the card's performance measurements use this setting.\n- `--pool_backing=fixed` commits the preset's memory pool up front instead of growing elastic backing.\n\nOn a stock host (8 MiB memlock) start loom-serve as `systemd-run --user --pty --same-dir -p SystemCallFilter=~io_uring_setup -p SystemCallErrorNumber=ENOSYS loom-serve ...` (no root; IREE falls back to its POSIX proactor), or raise `ulimit -l`.\n\nAMD Radeon AI PRO R9700 (gfx1201, 32 GB): this package does not fit its 32 GB (it needs about 118 GB)."
        }
      ],
      "install": "pipx install \"hrx-loom[hf]==0.2.0\"",
      "fetch": "loom-fetch huggingface:loom-fun/unsloth-Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-loom:vision-mtp --materialize=copy --output=Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-loom",
